      "say": "**This week, 2 to 8 November: 21 backtests**, 20 finished and 1 cancelled. 16 ran today, the others on 2, 3 and 4 November. 11 of today’s, #22 to #32, come from the sessions recorded for these docs.\n\n**Best by Sharpe**: [#23 Vast Galaxy](https://stage.candlestack.tech/backtests/bt_5vwx4qnfza), `docs-demo-gru.keras` on NVDA in the first half of 2024, +95.6 % with a Sharpe of 2.95. Buy and hold made +157.7 % in the same months, so it did not beat holding NVDA. Next is [#31 Soft Sirius](https://stage.candlestack.tech/backtests/bt_5usmt72n77), the same model on AAPL in the first half of 2023, +29.5 % and 2.62.\n\n**Largest return**: [#15 Bold Aries](https://stage.candlestack.tech/backtests/bt_os2inktwpu), the BLESK model on QQQ from 2021 to 2024, long and short, +180.4 % with a Sharpe of 1.35 and a largest fall of 17.6 %. Its fees are set to 0.001 %, a hundredth of your default 0.1 %, so the figure is flattered. The same model on QQQ over the same years with your default settings, long only, [#12 Rustic Gemini](https://stage.candlestack.tech/backtests/bt_6up676i7lz), lost 86.1 %.\n\n**Repeated runs**: #16, #17, #19, #20 and #21 are one setup, the BLESK model on SPY from 2025 to September 2026 with fees of 0.001 %. All five gave +51.5 % and a Sharpe of 1.65, see [#21 Icy Gemini](https://stage.candlestack.tech/backtests/bt_ozvqxf6az5). The engine gives the same result each time, so one run is enough. [#18 Vivid Alnilam](https://stage.candlestack.tech/backtests/bt_y7d4mqwfdj) was cancelled before it ran.\n\n**Weak spots**: [#26 Midnight Nova](https://stage.candlestack.tech/backtests/bt_nkfzxfmtoq) lost 42.0 % on NVDA in the second half of 2024, and on AAPL in the second half of 2023 all three models lost ([#28 Wavy Umbriel](https://stage.candlestack.tech/backtests/bt_7c5leihleb), [#30 Brave Rhea](https://stage.candlestack.tech/backtests/bt_pmkzny7t5j), [#32 Fleet Aldebaran](https://stage.candlestack.tech/backtests/bt_r7b4mlpxvw)). [#22 Serene Apogee](https: